  "notes": [
    "This is a terrain annotation, independent of unreleased building-contact masks. Native crop refinement separates horizontal paving from similarly textured vertical retaining faces; pixel review is still required before adoption.",
    "Black/unclassified pixels are not automatically water. Foreground public piles and retaining faces are not level support.",
    "Per-state paths and roots will be bound only after the art owner freezes all thirty-five frames. No physical baseline has passed.",
    "V2 narrow Roost horizontal walk replaces the earlier overbroad unaccepted support draft. Native frozen empty crop shows vertical cliff/stone face below y116; a frame contact there must be corrected in the art/registration, never blessed as level support.",
    "V3 central-route native crop corrects the actual two-flight stair switchback and its level return/cross-street. Earlier coarse middle-central-link polygon did not follow the depicted steps. All are frozen-background semantic observations, not fitted to building feet.",
    "V4 keeps the far-east cross-street/stair junction outside this preliminary horizontal trace until its individual native crop is classified; V3 initial31px junction overlap preserved. No terrain exception or stair-as-support waiver.",
    "V6 native source inspected. Newly painted hidden floor recoveries require their own horizontal top traces; old support strips and public-route gaps are not assumed correct."
  ],
